      "id": "config:helm/iedb-enterprise/values-local-storage.yaml",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "values-local-storage.yaml",
      "filePath": "helm/iedb-enterprise/values-local-storage.yaml",
      "summary": "本地存储模式的预设配置覆盖文件（storage.mode=local），为每个 iedb 节点（writer/reader/compactor）分配独立的 50Gi PersistentVolume 用于存储 Parquet 文件和 WAL，适用于裸机、边缘部署和无共享对象存储的环境。",
      "tags": ["configuration", "helm-chart", "local-storage", "persistence", "preset"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "config:helm/iedb-enterprise/values-shared-storage.yaml",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "values-shared-storage.yaml",
      "filePath": "helm/iedb-enterprise/values-shared-storage.yaml",
      "summary": "共享对象存储模式的预设配置覆盖文件（storage.mode=shared），使用内嵌 MinIO 作为 S3 兼容的后端存储，writer 仅需 20Gi PVC 存放 WAL，reader 使用 emptyDir，compactor 使用 20Gi 临时空间，适用于云原生 Kubernetes 部署。",
      "tags": ["configuration", "helm-chart", "shared-storage", "minio", "preset"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "config:helm/iedb-enterprise/values.schema.json",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "values.schema.json",
      "filePath": "helm/iedb-enterprise/values.schema.json",
      "summary": "JSON Schema（draft/2020-12）格式的 Helm values 校验规则定义，对 20 多个顶级配置项（镜像、许可证书、认证令牌、集群安全、存储模式、MinIO、writer/reader/compactor 角色、服务暴露、遥测、安全上下文等）进行类型、枚举值、最小值和字符串长度约束校验。",
      "tags": ["configuration", "json-schema", "validation", "helm-chart", "schema-definition"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "JSON Schema draft/2020-12 规范，对 writer.replicas 字段通过描述注明 2 副本被拒绝（Raft 脑裂风险），体现了跨字段约束的文档化方式。"
    },
    {
      "id": "config:helm/iedb-enterprise/values.yaml",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "values.yaml",
      "filePath": "helm/iedb-enterprise/values.yaml",
      "summary": "Helm Chart 的完整默认值配置文件，涵盖镜像仓库、许可证书、认证令牌、集群身份与安全（Raft 故障转移、对等复制调优）、两种存储模式（shared/local 及其详细子配置）、内嵌 MinIO、writer/reader/compactor 三个角色维度（副本数、资源配额、持久化、WAL 同步模式）、服务暴露、遥测开关以及 Pod 安全上下文的全部默认值。",
      "tags": ["configuration", "helm-chart", "default-values", "deployment", "enterprise"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    }
